WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.375 --> 00:00:03.083
Whoa. This is legit high. 

00:00:04.541 --> 00:00:06.125
- I'm scared.
- Me too. 

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:08.625
But I'm done letting fear 
stop me from living. 

00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:16.333
She just finished chemo 
a couple weeks ago. 

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:18.166
I'm not sure Ella is ready 
for school tomorrow.

00:00:18.166 --> 00:00:19.125
Carl, we've discussed this. 

00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:20.791
And the Santa Ana 
winds are blowing. 

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:22.500
I didn't catch cancer 
from the wind,

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.458
so I'm guessing it's not 
going to bring it back. 

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:26.750
Ella. Come on. 

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:30.000
I finally get to be 
a regular teenage girl. 

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.041
Staying up all night.

00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:32.958
Eating candy. 
Drinking soda. 

00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:34.166
Pretend I didn't hear
any of that. 

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.916
All your adventurousness has 
really rubbed off on me. 

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:40.125
Eww.

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:43.666
That is a side effect 
of my friendship. 

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:52.500
Today I'm alive. 

00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:57.166
And I don't plan on shying 
away from anything. 

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:02.000
Forget yesterday. 

00:01:02.166 --> 00:01:03.833
I want to make some 
new memories. 

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:05.750
Don't hit me with any 
of that meditation junk. 

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.083
Hey! That junk works. 

